{"availability":"available","full":"bocaletto-luca/IP-Geolocation-Finder","name":"IP-Geolocation-Finder","description":"A simple, 100% free, and open source web application that retrieves geolocation information for a given IP address using the ip-api.com API and displays a dynamic interactive map using Leaflet with OpenStreetMap tiles.  This project is built with pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, and styled using Bootstrap. No registration or API keys are required...","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":9,"forks":2,"created":"2025-05-30T20:42:24Z","updated":"2025-06-12T05:49:24Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bocaletto-luca.github.io/","topics":["api-free","bocaletto-luca","css3","database","finder-ip","free-data","html5","ip","ip-api","ip-geolocation","ip-geolocation-finder","javascript","open-data","open-source","responsive","webapp"],"demo":"https://bocaletto-luca.github.io/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T15:57:53.865Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T15:57:53.865Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T15:57:53.865Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T13:39:44.458Z","stars":9,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-17T15:57:53.865Z","stars":9,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":[],"features":["Dynamic IP Lookup: Enter an IP address, and the app retrieves geolocation details such as country, region, city, ZIP, latitude, longitude, timezone, ISP, and organization.","Interactive Map: View detailed results with a dynamic, interactive map (using Leaflet and OpenStreetMap) that updates based on the latitude and longitude.","Fullscreen Modal: Click \"View Details & Map\" to open a fullscreen modal showing comprehensive geolocation details along with an interactive map.","100% Free & Open Source: Uses free APIs (ip-api.com and OpenStreetMap) and libraries (Bootstrap, Leaflet) that require no registration.","Bilingual Comments: The source code includes bilingual (English and Italian) commen